{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38851","headline":"江下初秋寓泊 · 杜荀鹤","name":"江下初秋寓泊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蒙蒙烟雨蔽江村，江馆愁人好断魂。\n自别家来生白发，爲侵星起谒朱门。\n也知柳欲开春眼，争奈萍无入土根。\n兄弟无书鴈归北，一声声觉苦於猿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}